name: sim.getObjectType
description: Retrieves the type of an object
luaSynopsis: int objectType = sim.getObjectType(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int objectType = sim.getObjectType(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
outputs:
1. objectType: type of the object (sim.sceneobject_shape, sim.sceneobject_joint, etc. (see the object types)
